  "description": "Take everything that makes the Cronus a beast—and turn it up to eleven. The Cronus Elite Complete is our ultimate 26\" slopestyle machine, delivering a no-compromise build for riders who demand the very best. Built around the same aftermarket 6061-T6 aluminium Cronus frame, it combines pro-level geometry with a premium specification engineered for the biggest slopestyle features on the planet.\nLeading the charge is the legendary RockShox Pike DJ fork, providing exceptional control and confidence on the heaviest landings. The aftermarket Arise stem and handlebar offer precise handling, while the convertible Radio Sonar cassette & freecoaster hub and Radio Orbiter rims deliver lightweight strength and unwavering reliability through every take-off and landing.\nFrom boosting massive jumps and throwing technical tricks to flowing through park lines, the Cronus Elite is a high-performance machine built to keep pace with your biggest ambitions—session after session.",
